 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nDistribuciones Ibérica SL                         MASTER SERVICES\n                                                   AGREEMENT\nAvenida Diagonal 220, 08001 Barcelona, Spain\nCIF/NIF: ESB59442564\n\nFROM                                               FACTURAR A\n\nDistribuciones Ibérica SL                          Talleres Mediterráneo SA\nAvenida Diagonal 220                               Calle Mayor 15\n08001 Barcelona                                    28001 Madrid\nSpain                                              Spain\nVAT: ESB59442564\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 01/03/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Distribuciones Ibérica SL, with its registered office at Avenida Diagonal 220,\nBarcelona (\"Party A\"), and Talleres Mediterráneo SA, with its registered office at Calle Mayor 15,\nMadrid (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\n Party A   Distribuciones Ibérica SL / Lucía Fernández\n Party B   Talleres Mediterráneo SA / Lucía Fernández\n Date      01/03/2026",
